Use the system Node.js instead of the pinned download.

Upstream's prebuild downloads the exact Node release from nodejs.org
at build time and the Rust backend resolves that bundled copy at
runtime. OBS builds have no network, so skip the download and fall
back to /usr/bin/node (or $NODE_BINARY). The system nodejs24
satisfies the 24.x pin.

